title IoT telemetry
direction up

Field [color: gray] {
  Sensors [icon: sensor]
  Gateways [icon: router]
  Firmware updates [icon: download]
}
Connectivity [color: lightblue] {
  MQTT broker [icon: radio, description: EMQX]
  Device registry [icon: list]
  Cert authority [icon: key]
}
Processing [color: blue] {
  Rules engine [icon: workflow]
  Stream processor [icon: flink]
  Alerting [icon: alert, color: red]
}
Storage [color: purple] {
  Time series DB [icon: influxdb]
  Cold storage [icon: archive]
}
Apps [color: green] {
  Ops dashboard [icon: grafana]
  Mobile app [icon: mobile]
  Field technicians [icon: users]
}

Sensors > Gateways > MQTT broker: telemetry
Gateways <> Cert authority: mTLS
MQTT broker > Device registry
MQTT broker > Rules engine > Stream processor
Stream processor > Time series DB
Time series DB --> Cold storage: after 30 days
Stream processor > Alerting > Mobile app, Field technicians
Time series DB > Ops dashboard
Firmware updates --> Gateways: OTA
